name: ['Brazen Borrower // Petty Theft', 'Breeches, Brazen Plunderer', 'Bridge from Below', 'Carnage Tyrant', 'Crashing Footfalls', 'Dargo, the Shipwrecker', 'Desert', 'Desertion', 'Drown in the Loch', 'Fabricate', 'Field of the Dead', 'Gamble', 'Ghalta, Primal Hunger', 'Ghostly Prison', 'Kalamax, the Stormsire', 'Lord Windgrace', 'Lord of Atlantis', 'Malcolm, Keen-Eyed Navigator', 'Mana Crypt', 'Mephidross Vampire', 'Mirri, Weatherlight Duelist', 'Morbid Opportunist', 'Mystic Snake', 'Notion Thief', 'Pitiless Plunderer', 'Polyraptor', 'Port Razer', 'Prismatic Vista', 'Rampaging Ferocidon', 'Scapeshift', 'Show and Tell', 'Solitude', 'Star Compass', 'Stoneforge Mystic', 'Thrasios, Triton Hero', 'Tireless Tracker', 'Tragic Slip', 'Underworld Breach', 'Victimize']
